{"id": 7510, "html": "<div class=\"vc-modal\" data-controller=\"modals\" data-modals-target=\"modal\">\n  <div class=\"vc-modal__overlay\" data-action=\"click->modals#close modal.close@window->modals#close\" data-type=\"overlay\">\n      <div class=\"vc-modal__content-full\">\n\n<div class=\"p-deck-modal-card\">\n\n  <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card__head\">\n    <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-name\">ツイステみに劇場 トレイ･クローバー</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card__body\">\n    <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card__body-inner\">\n    \n      <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-layout\">\n        <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-layout__view\">\n\n          <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-view\">\n            <img class=\"p-deck-modal-card-view__image\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/prd-buildivide-static-7c153c/uploads/card/b7c13b0a474277d7f6c6d6ba8a0ed678/image_path.png?1788260135\" data-cards-target=\"image\">\n            <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-view__button\">\n      <a \n        data-cards-path-param=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/prd-buildivide-static-7c153c/uploads/card/b7c13b0a474277d7f6c6d6ba8a0ed678/image_path.png?1788260135\" \n        data-cards-active-class-param=\"is-active\"\n        data-cards-inactive-class-param=\"is-inactive\"\n        data-cards-target=\"turn\" \n        data-action=\"click->cards#turn\" \n        class=\"c-border-button is-active\">通常</a>    \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-layout__info\">\n\n          <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info\">\n            <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info__tag\">            \n              <label class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info__tag-item\">ユニット/バスター/エース</label>\n              <label class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info__tag-item\">クラブ</label>\n            </div>\n            <h2 class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info__name\">ツイステみに劇場 トレイ･クローバー</h2>\n            <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info__description\"><p>⁅永続⁆相手のメインフェイズ中、このユニットが受けるダメージ全てを０にする。\n<br />⁅自動⁆あなたのテリトリー開放中にこのユニットがバトルする時、バトル相手が赤なら、そのターン中、このユニットのパワーを＋5000。</p></div>\n            <ul class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info-data\">\n              <li>\n                <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info-data__half\">\n                  <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info-data-item\">\n                    <label>パワー</label><span>6500</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info-data-item\">\n                    <label>ヒット</label><span>2</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info-data-item\">\n                  <label>コスト</label><span>(黒1)/(無5)</span>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info-data-item\">\n                  <label>収録弾</label><span>PRカード(ブライト)</span>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-info-data-item\">\n                  <label>レアリティ</label><span>PR</span>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-share\">\n        <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-share__text\"><span>このカードを友達にシェアする</span></div>\n        <div class=\"p-deck-modal-card-share__center\">\n<ul class=\"vc-social-share-card\">\n  <li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https://tcg.build-divide.com/bright/cards/7510\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <ellipse style=\"stroke: rgb(24, 119, 242); fill: rgb(24, 119, 242);\" cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"15\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 26 16.061 C 26 10.506 21.524 6 16 6 C 10.476 6 6 10.506 6 16.061 C 6 21.084 9.656 25.247 14.436 26 L 14.436 18.97 L 11.898 18.97 L 11.898 16.061 L 14.436 16.061 L 14.436 13.846 C 14